Backport to SDL 3.4.18: upstream release-3.4.x commits ca97578d77 and
2ee7eb6212, verbatim. Applied by ios/scripts/setup-deps.sh.

iOS 27 made UIApplication.statusBarOrientation a no-op. 3.4.18's
UIKit_ComputeViewFrame trusts it and swaps width/height whenever it disagrees
with a window that matches the screen bounds, so a landscape window got a
portrait view frame (#150). Delete this patch once the pinned SDL is newer
than 3.4.18 and carries these commits.

From ca97578d77c374e0d0c5828b3c992cd11dca4a2f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
